<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="dark">
<title>Secure Student Portal · Cryptographic Verification Blueprint</title>
<!-- Link to our separated CSS file -->
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>

<header class="top">
  <div class="brand">
    <div class="mark">SSP</div>
    <div>
      <div class="title">Secure Student Portal</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="header-status">
    <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path></svg>
    Client-Side Encryption
  </div>
</header>

<div class="body">
  <nav class="side" aria-label="Main navigation">
    <div class="nav">
      <button data-go="auth"><span class="no">01</span>Authentication</button>
      <button data-go="dash"><span class="no">02</span>Dashboard</button>
      <button data-go="db"><span class="no">03</span>Database</button>
      <button data-go="lab"><span class="no">04</span>Security Lab</button>
      <button data-go="perf"><span class="no">05</span>Performance</button>
    </div>
    <p class="side-foot">Academic Prototype. State resets on reload.</p>
  </nav>

  <main>
    <section class="screen" id="auth">
      <div class="head">
        <span class="no">01</span>
        <h1>Authentication & Data Encryption</h1>
        <p>Registration and authentication occur within the client environment. The server only receives cryptographic hashes, ciphertext, and integrity digests.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="stack">
        <div class="card">
          <div class="tabs">
            <button class="tab on" data-tab="register">Student Registration</button>
            <button class="tab" data-tab="login">Portal Login</button>
          </div>
          <form id="form-register" autocomplete="off">
            <label for="r-user">JAMB Registration Number</label>
            <input id="r-user" placeholder="e.g., 202612345678AB" required>
            <label for="r-pass">Create Password</label>
            <input id="r-pass" type="password" placeholder="Minimum 6 characters" required>
            <label for="r-fee">Academic Standing</label>
            <input id="r-fee" value="Cleared for 2026/2027 Session" required>
            <button class="btn primary" type="submit">Encrypt & Store Record</button>
          </form>
          <form id="form-login" hidden autocomplete="off">
            <label for="l-user">Matriculation Number / JAMB No.</label>
            <input id="l-user" placeholder="e.g., 202612345678AB" required>
            <label for="l-pass">Password</label>
            <input id="l-pass" type="password" placeholder="Enter password" required>
            <button class="btn primary" type="submit">Authenticate & Decrypt</button>
          </form>
        </div>
        <div id="auth-result"></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="screen" id="dash">
      <div class="head">
        <span class="no">02</span>
        <h1>Student Dashboard</h1>
        <p>Official academic profile and decrypted status.</p>
      </div>
      <div id="dash-body"></div>
    </section>

    <section class="screen" id="db">
      <div class="head">
        <span class="no">03</span>
        <h1>Database Explorer</h1>
        <p>Direct representation of server-side storage. Demonstrates the absence of plaintext data.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="stack" id="db-body"></div>
    </section>

    <section class="screen" id="lab">
      <div class="head">
        <span class="no">04</span>
        <h1>Security Laboratory</h1>
        <p>Execute controlled experiments to validate system resilience against active and passive attacks.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:24px">
        <span class="hint" id="lab-prog" style="margin:0;font-size:13px;color:var(--text-2)"></span>
        <button class="btn small danger" id="reset">Reset State</button>
      </div>
      <div class="lab-container" id="lab-body"></div>
    </section>

    <section class="screen" id="perf">
      <div class="head">
        <span class="no">05</span>
        <h1>Performance & Audit</h1>
        <p>Execution timings for cryptographic operations and immutable audit logs.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="stack" id="perf-body"></div>
    </section>
  </main>
</div>

<nav class="bottom" aria-label="Main navigation mobile">
  <button data-go="auth">Auth</button>
  <button data-go="dash">Dash</button>
  <button data-go="db">DB</button>
  <button data-go="lab">Lab</button>
  <button data-go="perf">Audit</button>
</nav>

<!-- Load Scripts in this exact order -->
<script src="/js/ui.js"></script>
<script src="/js/lab.js"></script>
<script src="/js/client-crypto.js"></script>
</body>
</html>